    "url" : "doc:\/\/Documentation\/documentation\/Documentation\/NP-Ambassadors"
  },
  "kind" : "article",
  "metadata" : {
    "role" : "article",
    "roleHeading" : "Article",
    "title" : "NP Ambassadors"
  },
  "primaryContentSections" : [
    {
      "content" : [
        {
          "anchor" : "Overview",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Overview",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Ngee Ann Polytechnic (NP) Ambassadors are a student extension of the Corporate Communications Office, and",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "are responsible for running large public-facing events at the Polytechnic level, such as Open House, RED",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "Camp, and Youth Leaders Camp.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "I was an NP Ambassador from 2025 to 2026.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "RED-Camp",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "RED Camp",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Roadmap to Explore and Discover (RED) Camp is NP’s flagship event for graduating Secondary 4, Secondary 5,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "and ITE students. Students get to explore different academic schools, explore the campus and hear from current",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "NP students about student life.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Running RED Camp involved coordinating with student leaders from the different academic schools, as the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "programmes for each school was run by their own student leaders and not Ambassadors.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "One surprising thing about preparing for RED Camp was the amount of time spent practicing moving between venues,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "which is usually a part of the event hand-waved away. This is because Ngee Ann is a large and hilly campus, and",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "large groups of students can get lost, break away from the group, or slow down at tight corners, causing event delays.",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "This taught me about paying attention to small details in an event.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Red-Camp-Boot-Camp",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Red Camp Boot Camp",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Red Camp Boot Camp (RCBC) is a preparation camp for the recruited Student Leaders prior to RED Camp. I was",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "a member of the Product Knowledge (PK) subcommittee, in charge of content for the School of Film and Media Studies.",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "This meant I needed to know the content of that school incredibly well, such as each course’s target audience,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "curriculum, specialisations, industry connections, and career prospects.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The PK Subcommittee was also brought in as extra manpower for the RCBC Games. I learned to collaborate with people",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "from all eight academic schools, manage tight deadlines, and run games at the scale of hundreds of participants.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Open-House",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Open House",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "My role in Open House was a secondary school tour guide. I would lead groups of secondary school students to",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "a lecture theatre for a presentation, then to one academic school.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "When I was not leading secondary school students, I was a member of the Welcome Team, greeting people entering the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "campus. I am not an extrovert, so this level of public engagement forced me to be more confident with interacting",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "with strangers.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind" : "content"
    }
  ],
